### 5. fix `SettingsScreen.kt` date parsing helper

fixes finding 11: adds a robust `parseBirthYear` helper to prevent `StringIndexOutOfBoundsException` on varied date formats (`yyyy-MM-dd` vs `MM/dd/yyyy`).

in `app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/SettingsScreen.kt`, add this helper function at file level:

```kotlin
fun parseBirthYear(birthDate: String): Int {
    val clean = birthDate.trim()
    val parts = if (clean.contains("/")) clean.split("/") else clean.split("-")
    if (parts.isEmpty()) return 2000
    return if (parts[0].length == 4) {
        parts[0].toIntOrNull() ?: 2000
    } else {
        parts.lastOrNull()?.toIntOrNull() ?: 2000
    }
}

